{
  "name": "llm-gateway",
  "description": "A small, learning-oriented OpenAI-compatible LLM gateway that routes requests to OpenAI or Anthropic, providing virtual keys, usage and cost tracking, rate limits, budgets, retries, fallback, a circuit breaker, metrics, and caching. It ships with Kubernetes manifests and Terraform for an EKS deployment. Note: this project has over 100 source files; consider scoping analysis to a subdirectory for faster results.",
